T1  - Neurofunctional correlates of geometry and feature use in a virtual environment.
JF  - Journal of Experimental Psychology: Learning, Memory, and Cognition
A1  - Forloines, Martha R.
A1  - Reid, Meredith A.
A1  - Thompkins, Andie M.
